    }
   ],
   "note": "K线(1m/5m/1d)字段表：volume=成交量(无单位注记)、preClose=前收价、suspendFlag=停牌标记 0/-1/1、amount=成交额。供应商未在字段表声明 volume 单位(手/股)——units 门缺声明级直接证据。"
  },
  {
   "excerpt_id": "xtdata_py_fill_data_semantics",
   "original": "D:\\anaconda3\\envs\\vanna312\\Lib\\site-packages\\xtquant\\xtdata.py",
   "original_sha256": "a6c6939a0d9cf7d1b51ed1a1bb41140cbb37dbe2098084e617f872ddcf9d9909",
   "lines": [
    {
     "line": 4087,
     "text": "        K线可选字段："
    },
    {
     "line": 4088,
     "text": "            \"time\"                #时间戳"
    },
    {
     "line": 4089,
     "text": "            \"open\"                #开盘价"
    },
    {
     "line": 4090,
     "text": "            \"high\"                #最高价"
    },
    {
     "line": 4091,
     "text": "            \"low\"                 #最低价"
    },
    {
     "line": 4092,
     "text": "            \"close\"               #收盘价"
    },
    {
     "line": 4093,
     "text": "            \"volume\"              #成交量"
    },
    {
     "line": 4094,
     "text": "            \"amount\"              #成交额"
    },
    {
     "line": 4095,
     "text": "            \"settle\"              #今结算"
    },
    {
     "line": 4096,
     "text": "            \"openInterest\"        #持仓量"
    },
    {
     "line": 4097,
     "text": "    :param stock_list: 股票代码 \"000001.SZ\""
    },
    {
     "line": 4098,
     "text": "    :param period: 周期 分钟线\"1m\"/\"5m\"/\"15m\" 日线\"1d\""
    },
    {
     "line": 4099,
     "text": "    :param start_time: 起始时间 \"20200101\" \"20200101093000\""
    },
    {
     "line": 4100,
     "text": "    :param end_time: 结束时间 \"20201231\" \"20201231150000\""
    },
    {
     "line": 4101,
     "text": "    :param count: 数量 -1全部/n: 从结束时间向前数n个"
    },
    {
     "line": 4102,
     "text": "    :param dividend_type: 除权类型\"none\" \"front\" \"back\" \"front_ratio\" \"back_ratio\""
    },
    {
     "line": 4103,
     "text": "    :param fill_data: 对齐时间戳时是否填充数据，仅对K线有效，分笔周期不对齐时间戳"
    },
    {
     "line": 4104,
     "text": "        为True时，以缺失数据的前一条数据填充"
    },
    {
     "line": 4105,
     "text": "            open、high、low、close 为前一条数据的close"
    },
    {
     "line": 4106,
     "text": "            amount、volume为0"
    },
    {
     "line": 4107,
     "text": "            settle、openInterest 和前一条数据相同"
    },
    {
     "line": 4108,
     "text": "        为False时，缺失数据所有字段填NaN"
    },
    {
     "line": 4109,
     "text": "    :return: pd.DataFrame 字段对应的数据，各字段维度相同，index为为time_list,包含symbol列"
    },
    {
     "line": 4110,
     "text": "    '''"
    },
    {
     "line": 4111,
     "text": "    if period in {'1m', '5m', '15m', '30m', '60m', '1h', '1d', '1w', '1mon', '1q', '1hy', '1y'}:"
    },
    {
     "line": 4112,
     "text": "        return _get_market_data_ex_250414(field_list, stock_list, period, start_time, end_time, count, dividend_type, fill_data)"
    },
    {
     "line": 4113,
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "line": 4114,
     "text": "    return _get_tabular_data(stock_list, field_list, period, start_time, end_time, count, dividend_type=dividend_type, fill_data=fill_data)"
    }
   ],
   "note": "get_tabular_data docstring：fill_data=True 对齐时间戳时缺失数据 amount、volume 填 0、价格以前条 close 填充——零量行可能是 vendor 对齐填充行；1.3 下载调用 fill_data=True。"
  },
