  {
   "excerpt_id": "xttrader_md_order_volume_unit",
   "original": "D:\\anaconda3\\envs\\vanna312\\Lib\\site-packages\\xtquant\\doc\\xttrader.md",
   "original_sha256": "a107db985c78846292f55c83ae966f9ac5999e2b20b4aa3dda4950b84e17abab",
   "lines": [
    {
     "line": 1000,
     "text": "* 参数"
    },
    {
     "line": 1001,
     "text": "  - account - StockAccount 资金账号"
    },
    {
     "line": 1002,
     "text": "  - stock_code - str 证券代码，如'600000.SH'"
    },
    {
     "line": 1003,
     "text": "  - order_type - int 委托类型"
    },
    {
     "line": 1004,
     "text": "  - order_volume - int 委托数量，股票以'股'为单位，债券以'张'为单位"
    },
    {
     "line": 1005,
     "text": "  - price_type - int 报价类型"
    },
    {
     "line": 1006,
     "text": "  - price - float 委托价格"
    },
    {
     "line": 1007,
     "text": "  - strategy_name - str 策略名称"
    },
    {
     "line": 1008,
     "text": "  - order_remark - str 委托备注"
    },
    {
     "line": 1009,
     "text": "* 返回 "
    },
    {
     "line": 1010,
     "text": "  - 系统生成的订单编号，成功委托后的订单编号为大于0的正整数，如果为-1表示委托失败"
    },
    {
     "line": 1011,
     "text": "* 备注"
    },
    {
     "line": 1012,
     "text": "  - 无"
    },
    {
     "line": 1013,
     "text": "* 示例"
    },
    {
     "line": 1014,
     "text": "  - 股票资金账号1000000365对浦发银行买入1000股，使用限价价格10.5元, 委托备注为'order_test'"
    },
    {
     "line": 1015,
     "text": "```python"
    },
    {
     "line": 1016,
     "text": "account = StockAccount('1000000365')"
    },
    {
     "line": 1017,
     "text": "#xt_trader为XtQuant API实例对象"
    },
    {
     "line": 1018,
     "text": "order_id = xt_trader.order_stock(account, '600000.SH', xtconstant.STOCK_BUY, 1000, xtconstant.FIX_PRICE, 10.5, 'strategy1', 'order_test')"
    },
    {
     "line": 1019,
     "text": "```"
    },
    {
     "line": 1020,
     "text": "#### 股票异步报单"
    },
    {
     "line": 1021,
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "line": 1022,
     "text": "```python"
    },
    {
     "line": 1023,
     "text": "order_stock_async(account, stock_code, order_type, order_volume, price_type, price, strategy_name, order_remark)"
    },
    {
     "line": 1024,
     "text": "```"
    },
    {
     "line": 1025,
     "text": "* 释义 "
    },
